      "created": "2026-02-10T11:00:00.000Z",
      "modified": "2026-02-10T11:00:00.000Z",
      "lang": "en",
      "content": "4-week purple team exercise against Acme Financial Corp AD environment (180 DCs, 45,000 users, hybrid Azure AD). Red team achieved Domain Admin in 72 hours from initial phishing. Key findings: (1) TOTP MFA bypassed via Evilginx2 — FIDO2 required; (2) LSASS protection insufficient — Nanodump bypassed CrowdStrike; (3) Kerberoasting succeeded due to RC4-HMAC still enabled; (4) Lateral movement detected but too slowly — 6-hour MTTR exceeds 1-hour target.",
